  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Chimpanzee Protection and Raising Their Conservation Value in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) conducting a chimpanzee census in selected sites, including analyzing, mapping and reporting results; 2) conducting refresher training for research assistants; and 3) conducting a stakeholder meeting to disseminate census results, develop conservation interventions, and identify implementing partners.</narrative>
  </description>
